---
---
<section class="section-final-relaunch" id="inquiry">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fr-box">
      
      <div class="fr-content">
        <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; background: var(--bg-white); color: var(--brand-navy); border-color: var(--border-light);">
          Următoarea etapă a website-ului
        </span>
        <h2 class="fr-title">
          Ce trebuie să ofere mai bine website-ul dumneavoastră?
        </h2>
        <p class="fr-desc">
          Trimiteți-ne linkul website-ului actual și descrieți ce nu mai corespunde, ce trebuie păstrat și ce doriți să schimbați.
        </p>
        
        <div class="fr-action-area">
          <div class="url-mockup">
            <span class="url-prefix">URL actual:</span>
            <span class="url-placeholder">www.</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn-fr-primary">
            Discutați relansarea website-ului
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="fr-reassurance">
          <img src="/images/gabriel-antonio-pop.png" alt="Gabriel Pop" class="fr-avatar">
          <span>Gabriel Pop vă va răspunde personal.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-final-relaunch {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .fr-box {
    background: var(--bg-page);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }

  .fr-content {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .fr-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .fr-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .fr-action-area {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .url-mockup {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .url-prefix {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
  }

  .btn-fr-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--brand-navy);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1rem 2.2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-fr-primary svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-fr-primary:hover {
    background: #0f1b30;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(26, 47, 84, 0.2);
  }
  .btn-fr-primary:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .fr-reassurance {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .fr-avatar {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #ffffff;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .fr-box { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>
